Output docs/vhs/out/07-postman-import.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+W Type "i" Type "acme.postman_collection.json" F5 Sleep 2500ms Escape Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Q
